  "text": "I have put together a thoughtful ensemble for your office day that balances comfort with a polished look. The grey midi dress from rito.ua, with its soft knit and flattering turtleneck collar, creates a streamlined silhouette that emphasizes your waist while allowing ease of movement. The brown suede loafers add a touch of casual sophistication without sacrificing professionalism, and the beige tote brings a light, airy texture that brightens the overall palette. To complete the look, I included the embroidered brown stole; draped around your neck or worn loosely over the shoulders, its floral embroidery introduces a subtle pop of color and artistic detail to an otherwise neutral outfit.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wrap the embroidered stole snugly around your neck as a warm scarf for cooler mornings, or drape it casually off one shoulder as you leave the office for a relaxed evening transition."
  ],
