      "n": "#16·25",
      "text": "A soft grey midi dress crafted from a fine knit, featuring a high turtleneck and long sleeves that offer warmth without bulk. Its relaxed A-line cut flows gently over the hips, creating a clean vertical line that flatters your figure while maintaining a professional appearance suitable for an office setting."
    },
    {
      "n": "#346·11",
      "text": "Sleek brown suede loafers with a classic penny detail and a low block heel. The material provides durability and comfort for long days on your feet, while the rich earth tone adds depth to the neutral palette of your outfit."
    },
    {
      "n": "#53·23",
      "text": "An off-white canvas tote bag with delicate crochet paneling on the front. Its sturdy structure makes it practical for carrying your daily essentials, and the textured detail adds a handcrafted charm that elevates simple outfits."
    },
    {
      "n": "#473·38",
      "text": "A luxurious brown stole adorned with vibrant floral embroidery in shades of pink, blue, and gold, finished with delicate fringe. Its generous size allows for versatile styling as a cozy wrap or a dramatic outer layer."
    }
